Run a benchmark on a reserved, pinned CPU and record what else was running

Usage: isolated-bench <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run      Run one command pinned to the reserved CPUs
  reserve  Reserve the CPUs and monitor the machine for a harness that pins its own children
  busy     Run heavy work that is not a benchmark under the same lock
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
